# Things this folder generates rather than holds.
#
# The browser test builds a small page and installs the packages it needs, and
# neither belongs in the repository: the packages are described by the lock file
# beside them, and the built page is a few megabytes that would change on every
# rebuild for no reason anybody could read in a diff.
#
# The photographs are deliberately *not* ignored. They are the evidence that the
# test proved what it claims, and this project trusts a picture over a number.
node_modules
node_modules/
page/built/
test-results/
playwright-report/
